  "mode": "explicit-classified",
  "gaps": [
   "a .tftpl file is not parsed: no Pack claims the extension, so no fact is emitted for a template's own interpolations, conditionals or loops, and the questions 'what does this template interpolate' and 'which template file is this' are unanswerable from source",
   "omega-hcl states a function call by its name only, so the first argument of templatefile() -- the path of the template being rendered -- is not stated, and a render site cannot be linked to the file it renders",
   "the template attribute of a template_file data source, and any value assembled by file()/heredoc, are carried as declarations without their text",
   "template rendering results, provider-computed values and plan/state remain terminal runtime ceilings"
  ]
